# No automated unit tests

This project deliberately has **no** unit/integration test suite (see issue #210).

- Never create `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.spec.ts`, or `*.spec.tsx` files.
- Never add npm `test` scripts or Vitest/Jest/Testing Library dependencies.
- Never propose tests as part of a feature or bugfix unless the user explicitly asks to override this policy.
- Manual QA and `fixtures/` runtime data are the intended verification paths.
